name: "PHIGHTHOUSE Nuke Cannon"
description: '''
A nuke cannon that can destory enemy bases really well.
[purple]phighthouseium: slow speed, large damage, slow reload time, applies swocketized status to units.
[][#2cbfa2]medkitium: medium speed, slight decrease of damage, slightly faster reload time, has the ability to heal ally buildings.
[cyan]hyperlaserium: fast speed, decreased damage, shoots faster but uses more hyperlaserium.
'''
